# mandate-projection — a mandate is part of the canonical form: the actor node
# projects `mandate` as a set in ascending lexicographic order (§6, §9). The
# delegate's set is a subset of its delegator's, so the graph is well-formed.
actor boss mandate {rollback,deploy}
actor sub on-behalf-of boss mandate deploy
gate g risk low grant boss[deploy:low] sub[deploy:low]
cord g -> master
